。葬崇安陵。諡曰安后。兄晃義興太守。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0011","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0060"}],"interpretation_note":"本傳明記傳主之兄；兩處分錄。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-5-wyd","predicate":"brother","subject_person_id":"m9u_v4i_tk5","object_person_id":"009_19m_qao","qualifiers":{"source_term":"后兄昺"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-020","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd","source_id":"s-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002","quote":"宋世太祖為文惠太子納后桂陽賊至太祖在新亭傳言已沒宅復為人所抄掠文惠太子竟陵王子良奉穆后庾妃及后挺身送后兄昺之家事平乃出建元元年為南郡王妃四年為皇太子妃無寵太子為宮人製新麗衣裳及首飾而后牀帷陳設故舊釵鑷十餘枚永明十一年為皇太孫太妃鬱林即位尊為皇太后稱宣德宮贈后父金紫光祿大夫母桓氏豐安縣君其年十二月備法駕謁太廟高宗即位出居鄱陽王故第為宣德宮永元三年梁王定京邑迎后入宮稱制至禪位天監十一年薨年五十八葬崇安陵諡曰安后兄晃義興太守","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0010","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0052"}],"interpretation_note":"本傳明記傳主之兄；兩處分錄。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"昺","person_id":"009_19m_qao","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"昺之家存原句斷法；受贈之父承前父曄之。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"昺","person_id":"009_19m_qao","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"昺之家存原句斷法；受贈之父承前父曄之。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-5","predicat